1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:02,237
The teacher who treated Harry Potter like dirt

2
00:00:02,237 --> 00:00:04,550
spent the boy's whole life keeping him alive.

3
00:00:04,920 --> 00:00:06,232
Severus Snape was a lonely kid in

4
00:00:06,232 --> 00:00:07,408
a coat too big for him,

5
00:00:07,408 --> 00:00:08,232
when he saw a girl make

6
00:00:08,232 --> 00:00:09,895
a flower bloom in her hand.

7
00:00:10,265 --> 00:00:11,115
Lily Evans.

8
00:00:11,115 --> 00:00:11,877
He was the one who told

9
00:00:11,877 --> 00:00:13,040
her she was a witch.

10
00:00:13,385 --> 00:00:15,110
At Hogwarts, she went to Gryffindor.

11
00:00:15,110 --> 00:00:15,898
He went to Slytherin,

12
00:00:15,898 --> 00:00:17,560
and drifted toward the Dark Arts.

13
00:00:17,930 --> 00:00:19,755
Then, humiliated in front of everyone,

14
00:00:19,755 --> 00:00:20,818
he called her the one word

15
00:00:20,818 --> 00:00:22,155
he could never take back.

16
00:00:22,525 --> 00:00:23,238
She walked away.

17
00:00:23,238 --> 00:00:24,550
He chose Voldemort.

18
00:00:24,870 --> 00:00:26,408
He carried a prophecy to his master,

19
00:00:26,408 --> 00:00:27,945
then realized who it pointed to.

20
00:00:28,008 --> 00:00:29,095
Lily's son.

21
00:00:29,440 --> 00:00:30,878
He begged Voldemort to spare her.

22
00:00:30,878 --> 00:00:32,303
He begged Dumbledore to hide her.

23
00:00:32,303 --> 00:00:33,415
It wasn't enough.

24
00:00:33,760 --> 00:00:34,735
So he made a promise.

25
00:00:34,735 --> 00:00:36,385
Protect the boy with her eyes.

26
00:00:36,730 --> 00:00:38,080
That didn't make him kind.

27
00:00:38,080 --> 00:00:39,880
He was cruel to Harry, cruel to Neville,

28
00:00:39,880 --> 00:00:41,780
cruel to kids who couldn't fight back.

29
00:00:42,100 --> 00:00:43,500
But he kept that promise.

30
00:00:43,845 --> 00:00:45,645
When Dumbledore asked if he still loved her,

31
00:00:45,645 --> 00:00:46,508
after all this time,

32
00:00:46,508 --> 00:00:47,832
he answered with one word.

33
00:00:47,832 --> 00:00:48,795
Always.

34
00:00:49,345 --> 00:00:50,970
Dying, he asked Harry for one last thing.

35
00:00:50,970 --> 00:00:51,845
Look at me.

36
00:00:52,370 --> 00:00:53,195
Maybe so the last thing he

37
00:00:53,195 --> 00:00:54,370
ever saw was her eyes.
